/target
# cargo-fuzz artifacts (the fuzz crate is its own workspace)
fuzz/corpus
fuzz/artifacts
fuzz/coverage
# The fuzz harness resolves its own deps; the lockfile that describes what
# *ships* is the root one.
fuzz/Cargo.lock

# Local agent planning scratch, not part of the repository.
.harness/

# Cargo.lock IS tracked on purpose: CI runs `--locked`, and a pinned lockfile
# is what makes `cargo audit` / `cargo deny` / the SBOM describe the exact
# dependency set that ships. Do not re-add `Cargo.lock` here.
